{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787354429339339001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"unacademic-diabolic-esok","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"c7b4783512463577798fcd729c0c5a9f3a528d8a8429889e710e3f11c09da1af","event_uuid":"3453542f-b55d-4b7a-a742-85a04500c3b0","position":{"commit_sha":"367edf832d16adf7674b83492318d652015d8e69","position":"1787352077784852001-3453542f-b55d-4b7a-a742-85a04500c3b0"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"e90f4cc0516b08866236f08c5968509f77605514eafbd45c165441c76c72a182","event_uuid":"f665f0f8-ca1b-4726-96b4-ac67d39ea4d0","position":{"commit_sha":"b388e4f38649998e305e6185f6b6dccb98eee31c","position":"1787352083281866001-f665f0f8-ca1b-4726-96b4-ac67d39ea4d0"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787352077784852001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[],"description":"## Context / Problem\nFive modules derive \"where is `.rebar` / the sidecar directory for this store\" independently: `src/rebar/_store/hlc.py:80` (resolves symlinks), `src/rebar/_commands/compact_trigger.py:65` (resolves after bug `intangible-ladyish-vicuna`), `src/rebar/llm/enrich_drain.py:57` (resolves after `13f78e3165`), `src/rebar/_commands/doctor_locks.py:104`, `src/rebar/llm/overlap/queue.py:257`; `src/rebar/_store/push_state.py:89-116` parses `.git` by hand for the git dir and `src/rebar/_store/sync.py:281-301` re-derives the git common dir for quarantine. Three of these had the unresolved-symlink bug in turn (`nuclear-calm-heron`, `intangible-ladyish-vicuna`, `conscious-weighable-spittlebug`), each fixed one site per ticket.\n\n## Approach\nAdd `src/rebar/_store/paths.py` with one frozen `StorePaths(tracker)` exposing `canonical` (realpath), `git_dir`, `git_common_dir`, `rebar_dir`, `sidecar(name)`, `log(name)`; every derivation above becomes a call. The class is the only place `os.path.realpath` is applied to a tracker path for sidecar purposes, so an unresolved derivation cannot be re-copied. A guard test asserts no module outside `paths.py` computes `dirname(tracker)`/`.rebar` joins for sidecars (token scan on `\"/.rebar\"` joins plus `_rebar_dir` definitions, owner excluded, `# store-path-ok:` marker escape).\n\n## Scope\n`src/rebar/_store/paths.py` (new), `src/rebar/_store/hlc.py`, `src/rebar/_store/push_state.py`, `src/rebar/_store/sync.py`, `src/rebar/_commands/compact_trigger.py`, `src/rebar/_commands/doctor_locks.py`, `src/rebar/llm/enrich_drain.py`, `src/rebar/llm/overlap/queue.py`, `tests/unit/store/test_store_paths.py` (new).\n\n## Testing\nHappy path: a symlinked worktree tracker resolves every sidecar under the canonical store (real `tmp_path` symlink). Edge: a tracker whose `.git` is a gitfile (worktree) yields the common dir. Pinning: `tests/unit/test_compact_trigger.py`, `tests/unit/test_enrich_drain.py`, `tests/unit/test_hlc.py`, `tests/unit/test_push_pending_marker.py`, `tests/scripts/graph/test_doctor_locks.py` pass unchanged.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] `grep -rn \"def _rebar_dir\" src/rebar` returns only `src/rebar/_store/paths.py`; checked by the guard test and the grep.\n- [ ] Two worktrees sharing one store via symlink produce identical `sidecar(\"enrich-drain.lock\")` paths; checked by the new symlink test.\n- [ ] All five pinning test files pass with no assertion edits; checked by `pytest` on those files and `git diff --stat`.\n","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_store/paths.py","reason":"consolidation edit or new shared module/test"},{"path":"src/rebar/_store/hlc.py","reason":"consolidation edit or new shared module/test"},{"path":"src/rebar/_store/push_state.py","reason":"consolidation edit or new shared module/test"},{"path":"src/rebar/_store/sync.py","reason":"consolidation edit or new shared module/test"},{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/compact_trigger.py","reason":"consolidation edit or new shared module/test"},{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/doctor_locks.py","reason":"consolidation edit or new shared module/test"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/enrich_drain.py","reason":"consolidation edit or new shared module/test"},{"path":"src/rebar/llm/overlap/queue.py","reason":"consolidation edit or new shared module/test"},{"path":"tests/unit/store/test_store_paths.py","reason":"consolidation edit or new shared module/test"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","2ddd-b523-06da-4b4a"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"2ddd-b523-06da-4b4a","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["consolidation","janitor","fortnight-review"],"ticket_id":"6f18-05de-beaf-42be","ticket_type":"story","title":"One StorePaths derivation for the canonical store, git dir and sidecars","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["3453542f-b55d-4b7a-a742-85a04500c3b0","f665f0f8-ca1b-4726-96b4-ac67d39ea4d0"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787354429339339001,"uuid":"e1c98b3c-0835-4081-aa99-fd95f925c495"}